      <h1 class="article__title">Speaker rider</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This rider is adapted, with thanks, from the one generously shared by
        <a href="https://www.tatianamac.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Tatiana Mac</a>.
        If you'd like to adopt it yourself, please credit her work.
      </p>
